  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="84e7f8ec-02fe-5dc0-bf00-b1ebc5a9990c" activityNameId="110681bb-93a4-564d-8a40-a1951fac9878" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Glycerine, from rape oil, at esterification plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Glycerine, from rape oil, at esterification plant
Inventory refers to the production of 1 kg rape rape methyl ester, respectively glycerine, from rape oil. The multioutput-process 'rape oil, in esterification plant' delivers the co-products 'rape methyl ester, at esterification plant' and 'glycerine, from rape oil, at esterification plant'. Economic allocation with allocation factor of 97.8% to rape methyl ester. Allocation of CO2 emissions is done according to carbon balance.;
CAS number: 000056-81-5; 
Formula: C3H8O3; 
UUID: 6c5fb39d-91e1-38bd-a380-a57b314831ee
Original Author: Arnaud Dauriat; Author of updated dataset: Matthias Stucki. The update includes the allocation based on updated price information (208 CHF/ton glycerine).
Location: Data from biodiesel producers in CH, industrial data
Technology: Typical rape oil esterification plant designed for rape methyl ester (RME) production (for use in the vehicle fuels market), Swiss context. Rape oil base-catalyzed transesterification (based on industrial data from biodiesel producer in CH).
Time period: undefined
Production volume: Approx. 2.5-3 kt of vegetable oil were processed to methyl ester in 2004 in CH
Sampling: Data from biodiesel producers in CH, industrial data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6c5fb39d-91e1-38bd-a380-a57b314831ee.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
